   "availability": "sold_out",
   "description": "Three years in the making, inspired by the spectacular classic regatta races, the Antigua is a testament to creating a timepiece inspired by the past, but with a \"Big Eye\" on the present. The elegantly shaped 40mm case is fitted with a fully restored Landeron caliber 248 movement, a well respected vintage caliber used by many Swiss manufacturers during the 1960’s. The hunt in Switzerland for a vintage manual chronograph movement took us 2 years. We're extremely proud to offer this exceptional timepiece with this caliber.",
